+## 🧠 KairoForge Call
+
+The floating **KairoForge Call** panel near the bottom-right gives Holo a local voice/text
+control surface:
+
+- **Speaker** lets the built-in browser voice talk back.
+- **Talk** listens with browser speech recognition when your browser supports it.
+- **Keyboard** opens a holographic text keyboard. Drag its top bar to move it, use Rotate or
+  +/- to turn and scale it, or pinch with both hands and move in/out to resize it in the air.
+- **Hang up** ends the active call without closing the Holo page.
+
+Try commands like:
+
+```text
+add 3D item
+remove selected
+open keyboard
+send this to Creator mode
+```
+
+Computer and GitHub changes are handed to KairoForge Creator mode instead of letting the browser
+secretly run commands. That keeps file edits and publishing inside the guarded KairoForge workflow.
+
